{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_015","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"Dynamic Non-Fungible Tokens (dNFTs)","location_hint":"paragraph 85","char_start":2042,"char_end":2077,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_016","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 93","char_start":2184,"char_end":2214,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_017","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"NFTs are created on the blockchain. But the payload of the NFT, including media, metadata, and attributes can be stored in a variety of ways, including on the XRP Ledger; decentralized, off the XRP Ledger; and centralized, off the XRP Ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 104","char_start":2472,"char_end":2714,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_018","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"If your data is smaller than 256 bytes, you can consider using a data:// URI and embedding it directly in the URI field. This has the advantage of storing the data in a reliable, persistent, and responsive database.","location_hint":"paragraph 106","char_start":2735,"char_end":2950,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_019","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"Decentralized, off the XRP Ledger","location_hint":"paragraph 107","char_start":2952,"char_end":2985,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_020","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"You can use any of the existing decentralized storage solutions for your NFT metadata.","location_hint":"paragraph 108","char_start":2987,"char_end":3073,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_021","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"IPFS and Arweave offer solutions for decentralization. However, fetching the metadata efficiently can be a problem. Querying IPFS or Arweave directly to fetch metadata is not fast enough for modern websites that require immediate responses from users that are scrolling through multiple pages of NFTs that include high-quality media.","location_hint":"paragraph 109","char_start":3075,"char_end":3408,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_022","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"See the blog post NFT Payload Storage Options for some examples of cloud storage solutions.","location_hint":"paragraph 110","char_start":3410,"char_end":3501,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_023","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"Centralized, off the XRP Ledger","location_hint":"paragraph 111","char_start":3503,"char_end":3534,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_024","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"You can use the URI field to point to a webserver you maintain from which the payload is served.","location_hint":"paragraph 112","char_start":3536,"char_end":3632,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_025","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"As an alternative, and to save space on the ledger, you can set the Domain field of the issuer using AccountSet and treat the NFT ID of the token as a path on that domain. For example, if the NFT has an ID of 123ABC and the domain on the issuer is example.com , you could serve the payload from example.com/tokens/123ABC .","location_hint":"paragraph 113","char_start":3634,"char_end":3956,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_026","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"Previous page Non-Fungible Tokens","location_hint":"paragraph 118","char_start":4039,"char_end":4072,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_3cc91a11ac53_027","source_id":"src_3cc91a11ac53","source_hash":"889189c07e771bd8fe0f603f7db030c368d43a667d2fe4754e93e427aa704dda","text":"On the XRP Ledger Decentralized, off the XRP Ledger Centralized, off the XRP Ledger","location_hint":"paragraph 121","char_start":4114,"char_end":4197,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:37.168Z"}
